Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:52:24 +0800
Subject: MAINTAINERS: add the HiSilicon STB decoder and IR receiver entries

The VDH stateless decoder and the hix5hd2 infrared receiver have no
maintainer entries.
Both are media-platform drivers of this family.
Register each driver with the binding that describes it under linux-media.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)


diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index cda8fffcb989..751eec51a293 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -12087,6 +12087,13 @@ S:	Supported
 F:	Documentation/admin-guide/perf/hns3-pmu.rst
 F:	drivers/perf/hisilicon/hns3_pmu.c
 
+HISILICON HIX5HD2 INFRARED RECEIVER DRIVER
